.RS 4
\fI\fBp4est\fP\fP Fills \fCp4est->global_first_position\fP\&. p4est->first_local_tree must be set correctly\&. If this processor is not empty and first_quad is NULL, the first quadrant of the first local tree must be set correctly\&. 
