.SS "int p4est_comm_is_owner (\fBp4est_t\fP * p4est, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP which_tree, const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * q, int rank)"

.PP
Test ownership of a quadrant via p4est->global_first_position\&. The quadrant is considered owned if its first descendant is owned\&. Thus, a positive result occurs even if its last descendant overlaps a higher process\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fI\fBp4est\fP\fP Valid forest\&. 
.br
\fIwhich_tree\fP Valid tree number wrt\&. the forest\&. 
.br
\fIq\fP Valid quadrant wrt\&. the forest\&. 
.br
\fIrank\fP Rank whose ownership is tested\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if rank is the owner of the first descendant\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int p4est_comm_is_owner_gfp (const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * gfp, int num_procs, \fBp4est_topidx_t\fP num_trees, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP which_tree, const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * q, int rank)"

.PP
Test ownership of a quadrant via a global_first_position array\&. This array encodes part of the partition of a valid forest object\&. The quadrant is considered owned if its first descendant is owned\&. Thus, a positive result occurs even if its last descendant overlaps a higher process\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIgfp\fP Position array of length \fInum_procs\fP + 1\&. 
.br
\fInum_procs\fP Number of processes in this context\&. 
.br
\fInum_trees\fP Number of trees in this context\&. 
.br
\fIwhich_tree\fP Valid tree number wrt\&. the forest\&. 
.br
\fIq\fP Valid quadrant wrt\&. the forest\&. 
.br
\fIrank\fP Rank whose ownership is tested\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if rank is the owner of the first descendant\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "int p4est_comm_neighborhood_owned (\fBp4est_t\fP * p4est, \fBp4est_locidx_t\fP which_tree, int full_tree[], int tree_contact[], \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * q)"

